7. ACTION RECIPIENT CONTRACT
==================================================

Action Definition versions declare allowed recipient classes.

For M14.5A support:

INCIDENT_UNIT

INCIDENT_CREW_MEMBER

Do NOT make permanent OPERATIONAL_VEHICLE a command recipient.

A vehicle is inventory / physical equipment.

The incident unit is the operational command recipient.

