sort_order

Limits:

- maximum 10 parameters per Action Definition version;
- parameter code stable / bounded;
- choice list bounded, e.g. max 20;
- text bounded;
- complete submitted parameter payload bounded, e.g. <= 8 KiB.

Server validates submitted parameter values against the exact Action
Definition version.

Unknown keys reject.

Missing required values reject.

Wrong types reject.

No browser-only validation authority.

