Do NOT infer sector authority from geometry containment.

Unit Leader:
- may issue subordinate tasks only to active crew members of their own
  incident unit.

Do NOT automatically give Unit Leader authority over other units.

Deputy Commander:

Do NOT invent new blanket task/resource authority merely because the role
exists.

Preserve current command semantics unless an existing explicit capability
already grants the relevant authority.

If necessary, add a narrow server capability for task issuance with the
above explicit role scopes.

Do not use organization hierarchy as incident command authority.

