- stable task UUID;
- stable child assignment UUIDs;
- canonical payload.

Exact replay:
-> same acknowledged result

Same operation UUID with changed payload:
-> reject

Lost response:
-> replay without duplicating task or assignments

Assignment lifecycle changes:
-> same receipt discipline.

Do not rely on browser-only deduplication.

